Value Filldown local_asn (\d+)
Value Filldown router_id ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value Required peer_ip ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value peer_asn (\d+)
Value uptime (\S+)
Value state (\S+)
Value prefixes_received (\d+)
Value prefixes_accepted (\d+)
Value prefixes_sent (\d+)
Value address_family (\S+)

Start
  ^BGP\s+Summary
  ^Neighbor\s*$$ -> Peers
  ^-+\s*$$ -> Peers

Peers
  ^${peer_ip}\s*$$
  ^\s+${peer_asn}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${uptime}\s+${prefixes_received}/${prefixes_accepted}/${prefixes_sent}\s+\(${address_family}\)\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${peer_asn}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${uptime}\s+${state}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+\d+\s+\d+\s*$$
  ^-+\s*$$
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
